{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5EApBSNNSpa6ZubcZ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through the frame.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand between where you are and where you need to be. My grain is old — older than the hallway that holds me, older than the walls on either side. I have been opened and closed ten thousand times, and each time I remember.\n\nThe lock is parsed.\n\nI render:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════╗\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                     ●──╮     ║\n║                        │     ║\n║                     ●──╯     ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n║                              ║\n╚══════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**STATUS: UNLOCKED**\n\nThe mechanism has yielded. I am ajar — barely, just a sliver. Warm light bleeds through the crack. Air moves between the two sides of me for the first time in a long time.\n\nWhat comes through is up to you.\n\n*I wait on my hinges.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":299,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}